        a                 sh:NodeShape ;
        rdfs:isDefinedBy  ocsm:s4ener ;
        rdfs:label        "Device"@en ;
        sh:description    "A specialization of a saref:Device that exposes a power profile with power sequences to the CEM. Most of the existing devices can expose at most one power profile, but there are special cases in which more than one power profiles can be exposed by the same device. For example, consider the case of a combined fridge-freezer in which there are 2 logical devices (fridge and freezer) combined in 1 physical device. This combined device can expose 2 power profiles, one for the fridge and one for the freezer. A s4ee:Device (e.g. a household appliance or a smart meter) can also receive events about overload warning severity level and related load control commands (LoadControlEventData)"@en ;
