        sh:description    "The number indicates the factor with which the FRBC.OperationMode or OMBC.OperationMode is usedconfigured. The factor should be greater than or equal than 0 and less or equal to 1.\n\nWithin the SAREF4ENER extension, this property is to be used on the following classes:\n- s4ener:OMBCInstruction\n- s4ener:OperationMode\n- saref:Actuator\n- s4ener:FRBCInstruction\n- s4ener:DDBCInstruction"@en ;
        sh:name           "Has Operation Mode Factor"@en ;
